#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For information on launching the IBM Cloud Logs UI, see the [Launching the UI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs?topic=cloud-logs-instance-launch#instance-launch-cloud-ui) in the IBM Cloud Logs documentation.\n"
msgstr "למידע על הפעלת ממשק המשתמש של IBM Cloud Logs, ראו את [Launching the UI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs?topic=cloud-logs-instance-launch#instance-launch-cloud-ui) בתיעוד IBM Cloud Logs.\n"

#. type: Plain text
